  "jei.femboymod.info.backpack": "Right-click to open, sneak + right-click to wear it on your back. Upgrade canvas to leather in a crafting grid and leather to netherite at a smithing table; the contents are kept. A backpack can't go inside another backpack.",
  "jei.femboymod.info.charm": "Put it into the charm slots of an open backpack. Charms hang on the side of the backpack and give a small bonus while you wear it.",
  "jei.femboymod.info.cosmetic": "Wearable cosmetic. Right-click to put it on, or use the Cosmetics screen (button in your inventory, or bind a key in Controls). Everything you wear adds to your Drip Level, and full sets give set bonuses.",
  "jei.femboymod.info.dyeable": "Dye it in a crafting grid, like leather armor. Pride colorways are sold by the Thrifter villager at the highest level.",
